Begin Exploring Related Columns
Relevant columns and their potential usage  
• ADDRESS: contract address, used to filter for the USDT‑TRON contract 0xa614f803b6fd780986a42c78ec9c7f77e6ded13c  
• EVENT_HASH: indexed topic 0, used to filter the Transfer event 0xddf252ad…3b3ef  
• ARGS: JSON string that holds ["from","to","value"]; must be parsed to get sender, receiver, raw value  
• BLOCK_NUMBER: block height to display with every transfer  
• BLOCK_TIMESTAMP: optional if you also want the date/time of the transfer  
• TRANSACTION_HASH / LOG_INDEX: optional tie‑back to the exact log  
• REMOVED: ignore re‑orged events (keep REMOVED = FALSE)

Typical conditions that will be applied  
1. ADDRESS = '0xa614f803b6fd780986a42c78ec9c7f77e6ded13c'  
2. EVENT_HASH = '0xddf252ad1be2c89b69c2b068fc378daa952ba7f163c4a11628f55a4df523b3ef'  
3. REMOVED = FALSE  
4. Ordering by the parsed value/1e6 DESC  
5. LIMIT 3  

